abstract: >-
  Time-to-event analysis for clinicopathological research in 'jamovi':
  Kaplan-Meier estimates, log-rank tests, Cox regression, competing-risk
  cumulative incidence, cut-off analysis of continuous markers,
  multivariable and LASSO Cox models, odds ratios, and preparation of
  dates and outcomes for survival analysis.
